# Full Speed Ahead! (jeuno 179): a WAR 19 with the license and the map: no offer (10222). The var 4 (GM) while the
# quest is available: 10225 all the same (the var arm comes before the status arms) and its finish completes it;
# Quest[3][179]Prog 1 (GM) kept (the raw player:completeQuest).
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-52.8,8.2,85.9 job=WAR lvl=19
keyitem ChocoboLicense
keyitem MapOfTheJeunoArea
login
trigger Mapitoto                        # the turn: 10222
finish
trigger Mapitoto                        # level 19: no arm (10222 again)
finish
charvar [QUEST]FullSpeedAhead 4
trigger Mapitoto                        # the turn: 10222
finish
charvar Quest[3][179]Prog 1             # a GM: the quest's own var (the raw completeQuest keeps it)
trigger Mapitoto                        # available, the var 4: 10225
finish                                  # completed from available; the var 0; fame; the whistle; Raptor Companion
